    {
      "id": "76d5634707fcf8e06ab8288d4a667ba6ff37ca2d",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2187491673,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Sure. \n\nThis is an E2AP pcap file: [e2sm_kpm_test.pcap](/uploads/81cdcd381a63926d413866b3293acf63/e2sm_kpm_test.pcap)\n\nYou have to configure User DLT 155 for E2AP.\n\nThe 3rd message is a RIC Indication that contains measurements record of integer and real type.\nI have put the following values for:\n- real (floats): {0.0, NAN, std::numeric_limits<float>::infinity(), 0.15625, 2.0, 4.00001, 1234.1234}\n- integers: {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7}.\n\nHere screenshot:\n![image](/uploads/753124350ecb3e07255cf2dc39265fac/image.png)",
          "author": {
            "id": 12422961,
            "username": "piotr.gawlowicz",
            "public_email": null,
            "name": "Piotr Gawłowicz",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/df6f61b5ae6f9732e25037d1d643dd59495b99e2c1eb695e790f73976221456e?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/piotr.gawlowicz"
